  <emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 xml:lang="en">Precise and univocal description of an ontological entity in the framework of an axiomatic system.</emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9>
