  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">TotalLinearStoppingPower</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">For charged particles of a given type and energy E0 the differential quotient of E with respect to x, where E is the mean energy lost by the charged particles in traversing a distance x in the given material.</rdfs:comment>
