  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">machining with a circular cutting movement in which the axis of rotation of the tool and the axis of the internal surface to be produced are identical and the feed movement is in the direction of this axis. The axis of rotation of the cutting movement maintains its position relative to the workpiece independently of the feed movement (axis of rotation workpiece-bound).</rdfs:comment>
