  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">FractionUnit</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Quantities that are ratios of quantities of the same kind (for example length ratios and amount fractions) have the option of being expressed with units (m/m, mol/mol to aid the understanding of the quantity being expressed and also allow the use of SI prefixes, if this
is desirable (μm/m, nmol/mol).
-- SI Brochure</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Unit for fractions of quantities of the same kind, to aid the understanding of the quantity being expressed.</rdfs:comment>
  <core:altLabel xml:lang="en">RatioUnit</core:altLabel>
  <core:exactMatch rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_c2f5ee66_579c_44c6_a2e9_fa2eaa9fa4da</core:exactMatch>
