  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">GrandCanonicalPartionFunction</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Sum of canonical partition function Z (NA,NB,…) for the given number of particles A, B, ... multiplied by absolute activities of particles A, B, ...</rdfs:comment>
