  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">ThermodynamicEfficiency</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Performance measure of a device that uses thermal energy, expressed as the ratio of work done over thermal energy used.</rdfs:comment>
