  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">NeutronYieldPerAbsorption</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Average number of fission neutrons, both prompt and delayed, emitted per neutron absorbed in a fissionable nuclide or in a nuclear fuel, as specified.</rdfs:comment>
