  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Solubility</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The analytical composition of a saturated solution, expressed in terms of the proportion of a designated solute in a designated solvent, is the solubility of that solute.</rdfs:comment>
  <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The solubility may be expressed as a concentration, molality, mole fraction, mole ratio, etc.</rdfs:comment>
