  <emmo:elucidation xml:lang="en">The relation between a process P1 that proper overlaps a process P2, where the non-overlapping part of P2 is caused by P1.</emmo:elucidation>
  <emmo:illustration rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/emmo-repo/EMMO/master/doc/figs/hasProcessOutput.png</emmo:illustration>
</owl:AsymmetricProperty>

